<div id="u-credit-00213-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6306406&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608492989" alt="ScorpionidaSlaughter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6306406)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;">ScorpionidaSlaughter</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1589957654 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">20 May 2020 06:54</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00375/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一套羽毛球拍，当有人使用其任意一把时所有对方的发球都使使用者无法击中羽毛球。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/4/1<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>一家羽毛球馆。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被陈列于Site-CN-12的低价值物品保存柜中。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>nmd，哪个[数据删除]的在我和 ██站友谊赛的时候换成这玩意的？</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
